<title>MEXICO: TEXAS TO MEXICO LIVESTOCK EXPORT WEEKLY - USDA.</title>
<headline>TEXAS TO MEXICO LIVESTOCK EXPORT WEEKLY - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Tuesday updated figures of livestock exports to Mexico from the state of Texas to Aug 11.</p>
<p>Species		   Wk-To-Date   Yr-Date   Last Year</p>
<p>1) Beef Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		720	    71,740     65,840</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   0	     1,776	  900</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	 0	     2,719	1,351</p>
<p>2) Hogs</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		  0	     1,063     31,831</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   0		 499	  314</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	 0	     6,375	1,613</p>
<p>3) Dairy Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Breeding Males	   0		 167	   37</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Females     322	    18,071	7,879</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
